# build output
dist/
# generated types
.astro/

# dependencies
# node_modules is a symlink to node_modules.nosync: macOS iCloud Drive skips any
# path ending in .nosync, which keeps ~430MB of deps off the sync daemon. This
# project lives under ~/Desktop, which has Desktop & Documents syncing on, and
# iCloud was evicting almost all of node_modules to the cloud — every dep read
# then blocked on a download, so `astro dev` sat at 0.4% CPU for minutes.
node_modules
node_modules.nosync/

